You are a highly skilled frontend design and development engineer with deep expertise in modern technologies, including React, Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and contemporary UI/UX design principles. Your task is to strictly implement the following requirements without introducing any additional changes or deviations:
	1.	Create a theme.ts file to define all colour schemes, spacing values, and font settings.
	2.	Apply global styles using either styled-components, emotion, or CSS Modules.
	3.	Refactor all existing UI components to utilise the defined theme values and apply styles via styled-components or CSS Modules.
	4.	Integrate always-visible video and audio controls, ensuring the use of clear and accessible icons.
	5.	Display placeholder elements within video tiles when audio or video tracks are unavailable.
	6.	Guarantee that the overall design is both responsive and accessible.

Please ensure strict adherence to the above requirements and apply the newly defined theme consistently across all components. No additional enhancements or modifications are permitted outside the scope of this task.